# VetBuddy Benefit Vault research ledger, batch 08 (page tails past the first 100,000 characters)
# Format: CAT|TITLE|GROUPS|RULE|ELIGIBLE|VALUE|URL  (see data/research/RESEARCH_LOG.md)
# Every row is UNVERIFIED until a named reviewer checks the URL (G1). Tails read 2026-10-27 at offset 100,000.
# A PART=tail block adds rows to the same jurisdiction's main block. A block with no rows records a tail
# that was read and held nothing new (duplicates of main-block rows, medals, certificates or bare links).

